# ritz1/src/emitter_consts.ritz - module-level data: global initializers, integer const resolution, const arrays of struct literals, scalar struct consts, the string-literal type
#
# Split from emitter.ritz by AGAST #1818 (no hand-written file over 3,000
# SLOC); emitter `pub import`s it, so its importers see these unchanged.

